(PubMed:1907282). Also functions as an activator of the sialidase NEU1 (PubMed:37205763). This protein is also a carboxypeptidase and can deamidate tachykinins (PubMed:1694176, PubMed:1756715, PubMed:1907282)."}],"uniprot_source":"UniProtKB/Swiss-Prot Function, release 2026_04","retrieved":"2026-10-21"}],"structures":[],"alphafold_accessions":[]}